               "MIBs/OIDs are the vocabulary: 1.3.6.1.2.1.1.3.0 is sysUpTime. You do not memorize OIDs \u2014 you know that snmpwalk discovers them and templates map them.",
               "Traps (device-initiated alerts) vs polling (manager-initiated queries): traps for events, polling for trends. Both \u2014 traps alone miss silent failures.",
